{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-awesome-all-timeline-js","path":"/2021/12/02/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Track Awesome List"}},"allAwesomeItem":{"nodes":[{"awesomeListRepo":"hangtwenty/dive-into-machine-learning","categoryHTML":"<h2>Tools you'll need</h2><h3>If you prefer local installation</h3>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://www.python.org/\">Python</a>. Python 3 is the best option.</li>","updatedAt":"2021-12-02T23:07:10.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"hangtwenty/dive-into-machine-learning","categoryHTML":"<h2>Tools you'll need</h2><h3>If you prefer local installation</h3>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://jupyter.org/\">Jupyter Notebook</a>. (Formerly known as IPython Notebook.)</li>","updatedAt":"2021-12-02T23:07:10.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"hangtwenty/dive-into-machine-learning","categoryHTML":"<h2>Tools you'll need</h2><h3>If you prefer local installation</h3>","itemHTML":"<li>Some scientific computing packages:\n<ul>\n<li>numpy</li>\n<li>pandas</li>\n<li>scikit-learn</li>\n<li>matplotlib</li>\n</ul>\n</li>","updatedAt":"2021-12-02T23:07:10.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"hangtwenty/dive-into-machine-learning","categoryHTML":"<h2>Jargon note</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"http://www.quora.com/What-is-the-difference-between-Data-Analytics-Data-Analysis-Data-Mining-Data-Science-Machine-Learning-and-Big-Data-1\">What is the difference between Data Analytics, Data Analysis, Data Mining, Data Science, Machine Learning, and Big Data?</a></li>","updatedAt":"2021-12-02T23:07:10.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"hangtwenty/dive-into-machine-learning","categoryHTML":"<h2>Jargon note</h2>","itemHTML":"<li>Another handy term: <a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/articles/what-does-a-data-engineer-do-and-how-do-i-become-one\">\"Data Engineering.\"</a>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://ml-ops.org/\">\"MLOps\"</a> overlaps with Data Eng, and there's <a href=\"#production-deployment-mlops\">an introductory MLOps section later in this guide</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>","updatedAt":"2021-12-02T23:07:10.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"hangtwenty/dive-into-machine-learning","categoryHTML":"<h2>Other courses</h2>","itemHTML":"<li>Coursera's <a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/specializations/jhu-data-science\">Data Science Specialization</a></li>","updatedAt":"2021-12-02T23:07:10.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"hangtwenty/dive-into-machine-learning","categoryHTML":"<h2>Other courses</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://cs109.github.io/2015/\">Harvard CS109: Data Science</a></li>","updatedAt":"2021-12-02T23:07:10.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"hangtwenty/dive-into-machine-learning","categoryHTML":"<h2>Other courses</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://www.quora.com/How-can-I-become-a-data-scientist?redirected_qid=59455\">An epic Quora thread: How can I become a data scientist?</a></li>","updatedAt":"2021-12-02T23:07:10.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"hangtwenty/dive-into-machine-learning","categoryHTML":"<h2>Supplement: Cheat Sheets</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"http://scikit-learn.org/stable/tutorial/machine_learning_map/\">scikit-learn algorithm cheat sheet</a></li>","updatedAt":"2021-12-02T23:07:10.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"hangtwenty/dive-into-machine-learning","categoryHTML":"<h2>Supplement: Cheat Sheets</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://stanford.edu/~shervine/teaching/cs-229/\">Stanford CS 229 cheat sheets</a>, available on the web and <a href=\"https://github.com/afshinea/stanford-cs-229-machine-learning/tree/master/en\">as PDFs</a>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://stanford.edu/~shervine/teaching/cs-229/cheatsheet-supervised-learning\">Supervised learning cheat sheet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://stanford.edu/~shervine/teaching/cs-229/cheatsheet-unsupervised-learning\">Unsupervised learning cheat sheet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://stanford.edu/~shervine/teaching/cs-229/cheatsheet-deep-learning\">Deep learning cheatsheet</a> <a href=\"https://stanford.edu/~shervine/teaching/cs-230/\">(more)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https: